this is one of those interesting illusions ...

minor SPOILER ALERT!!! {... corpse generation ...}

if i didn't know better i'd swear that if you "just hit" a monster
near death with a dart or rock then it would leave a corpse.  i even
play like this (for purely superstitious reasons).

the facts are that large monsters (and a few special cases) are mostly
guaranteed to leave a corpse.  other monsters have less of a chance
based upon a class attribute for that monster.  this means that small
monsters will rarely leave corpses independent of whether or not your
weapon was Mjollnir or bare-handed, whatever ...

